    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/467fe109f77c1ec2544d56896833673a.avif?t=1754333640\" data-has-big width=800 height=206 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of bouncy fluffballs and conquer challenging levels! Master precision controls and fast reflexes as you zip through courses filled with surprising obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/03139641f11b6c6230fc021a4382b3b8.poster.avif?t=1754333640\" width=640 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/03139641f11b6c6230fc021a4382b3b8.webm?t=1754333640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/03139641f11b6c6230fc021a4382b3b8.mp4?t=1754333640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/26a87c1c902f2ce258d7d457676cc47a.avif?t=1754333640\" data-has-big width=800 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins scattered across each level to unlock new customization options for your fluffball.  But don't worry these customizations are not locked behind monetization strategies (NO IN-GAME PURCHASES). So do the good old fashion unlock customizations by PLAYING.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/969d2251226817b2c84a348a2910dc4f.avif?t=1754333640\" data-has-big width=1600 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/4103634668a85f2957786e08789fc365.poster.avif?t=1754333640\" width=640 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/4103634668a85f2957786e08789fc365.webm?t=1754333640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/4103634668a85f2957786e08789fc365.mp4?t=1754333640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/a013c3bafcfdd474eff8fbf7fe1430ed.poster.avif?t=1754333640\" width=640 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/a013c3bafcfdd474eff8fbf7fe1430ed.webm?t=1754333640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/a013c3bafcfdd474eff8fbf7fe1430ed.mp4?t=1754333640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/2dc38df29fb05ab6b356ba1550918cac.avif?t=1754333640\" data-has-big width=800 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluff\u2019n\u2019Roll is not for the faint-hearted! Each level presents tougher terrain, with new obstacles and hazards that push your skills to the limit. Every failure is a lesson. Master each course, learn the terrain, and perfect your fluffball skills with every try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/ebc947dc907dcb98cd456961a3c45feb.poster.avif?t=1754333640\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/ebc947dc907dcb98cd456961a3c45feb.webm?t=1754333640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/ebc947dc907dcb98cd456961a3c45feb.mp4?t=1754333640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
